        "body": "Phillips 66's obligations rose from $329M in FY21 to $479M in FY23, then moved to $443M in FY24 and peaked at $640M in FY25. Phillips 66 obligated $582M in FY26 to date, which is down 9.1% year over year compared with the prior period."
